OL,3,GNEWSA'Beautiful young soul' dies after
OL,4,Amotorcycle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 19-year-old who died
OL,7,Fafter a crash have said the decision of
OL,8,Fthe "beautiful young soul" to donate
OL,9,Fhis organs will help others.
OL,11,FHarry Douglas, 19, from Liverpool, died
OL,12,Fon Thursday after a collision involving
OL,13,Fa motorcycle on the East Lancashire
OL,14,FRoad in St Helens, Merseyside, four
OL,15,Fdays earlier.
OL,17,FHis family said he was a "kind hearted
OL,18,Flad" who was devoted to his mum, sister
OL,19,Fand partner, adding "everything he did
OL,20,Fin life was for their benefit".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
